### Komponen 2: Lupa Username/Password — Self-Service Reset

#### [NEW] [AccountRecoveryController.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/sipaduhok/app/Http/Controllers/Auth/AccountRecoveryController.php)
- `showForm()` — Tampilkan form lupa akun
- `submitRequest()` — Proses permintaan reset berdasarkan identitas
- `showResetForm($token)` — Form reset password via token
- `processReset()` — Proses reset password

#### [NEW] [create_account_recovery_tokens_table migration](file:///c:/laragon/www/sipaduhok/database/migrations/2026_03_03_create_account_recovery_tokens_table.php)
Tabel `account_recovery_tokens`:
- [id](file:///c:/laragon/www/sipaduhok/app/Models/User.php#46-50), `user_id`, `token` (hash), `type` (username/password), `expires_at`, `used_at`, `created_at`

#### [NEW] [create_account_recovery_tickets_table migration](file:///c:/laragon/www/sipaduhok/database/migrations/2026_03_03_create_account_recovery_tickets_table.php)
Tabel `account_recovery_tickets` (untuk user tanpa nomor HP):
- [id](file:///c:/laragon/www/sipaduhok/app/Models/User.php#46-50), `user_id`, `type`, `status` (pending/resolved/rejected), `identity_data` (JSON), `resolved_by`, `resolved_at`, `notes`, `timestamps`

#### [NEW] [forgot-account.blade.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/sipaduhok/resources/views/auth/forgot-account.blade.php)
- Form dengan pilihan role → field identitas yang sesuai
- Tampilan responsive dengan design konsisten dengan login page

#### [NEW] [reset-password.blade.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/sipaduhok/resources/views/auth/reset-password.blade.php)
- Form input password baru + konfirmasi (via token link)

#### [MODIFY] [login.blade.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/sipaduhok/resources/views/auth/login.blade.php)
- Tambah link "Lupa Username atau Password?" di bawah tombol login

#### [MODIFY] [web.php](file:///c:/laragon/www/sipaduhok/routes/web.php)
- Routes untuk forgot account flow

